00:21:29.834 --> 00:21:32.896
Independence Day, Men in Black.

00:21:32.896 --> 00:21:36.858
So it was like, it really captured a time.

00:21:36.858 --> 00:21:38.917
So it's very difficult.

00:21:38.917 --> 00:21:40.475
